    <th>Mac (Chip/Capacity)</th><br/>
    <th>Read Speeds</th><br/>
    <th>Write Speeds</th><br/>
  </tr><br/>
  <tr><td>MacBook Neo (A18 Pro/256GB)</td><td>1,735 MB/s</td><td>1,684 MB/s</td></tr><br/>
  <tr><td>MacBook Air (M1/512GB)</td><td>3,422 MB/s</td><td>3,274 MB/s</td></tr><br/>
